    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(c) the project the sharing is part of is covered by a registered data sharing agreement that is in effect and that meets the requirements of this Act;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The sharer shares with an accredited user if the project is covered by a registered data sharing agreement.";
